== Kernel Modifications ==

The only file that needs to be modified is ''target/linux/ar71xx/files/arch/mips/ar71xx/mach-dir-600-a1.c'' as  part 1 of [[:toh:d-link:dir-615:ex-usb]].

I have tried this on Backfire 10.03.1-rc4 and confirmed it working. This should also apply to any other Backfire builds as well as trunk but has not been tested by me yet.

  - Download SVN source code
  - Backup by copying ''target/linux/ar71xx/files/arch/mips/ar71xx/mach-dir-600-a1.c'' to a completely different location (in case something goes wrong)
  - Edit file ''target/linux/ar71xx/files/arch/mips/ar71xx/mach-dir-600-a1.c''
    * Add line <color blue>//#include "dev-usb.h"//</color> after line <color blue>//#include "dev-leds-gpio.h"//</color>
    * Add line <color blue>//ar71xx_add_device_usb();//</color> after line <color blue>//ar71xx_add_device_eth(0);//</color>
    * Note: order of lines pasted does not necessarily matter as long as they are in their corresponding sections or methods
  - Run 'make menuconfig' and select platform/profile (atheros ar71xx/Dir-600-a1) and other packages discussed in the next section
  - Compile the image and flash it to the router

